  "description": "The Knightwood is a lightweight gravel ripper built to fly, but not at the expense of comfort. Designed around a 48mm tyre, it combines a clean, stripped-back aesthetic with the ability to take on more than just smooth gravel. It’s elegant, capable, and surprisingly forgiving when the road gets rough.\nWith a mid/neutral trail, the Knightwood strikes that sweet spot between responsiveness and stability. Quick to react, yet composed under pressure. Sliding dropouts let you run it single-speed or dial in your ideal chainstay length, making it as versatile as it is beautiful.\nMinimal by design, refined in execution, the Knightwood keeps things simple, but never basic.",
